invariant: INV-16
file: webpki_ticket.c
catches: hash_runtime_test
reason: a ticket's binding runs its HMAC on sha256.c whatever the session's
  ch_cfg.cpu states (docs/decisions.md 132). bin/hash_runtime_test's
  webpki_ticket_binding row counts the HMAC's calls on the wrong path.

--- old
    hmac_sha256_cpu(cpu, psk, psk_len, msg, w.len, out);
--- new
    (void)cpu;
    hmac_sha256(psk, psk_len, msg, w.len, out);
